                        href="{{organizationButtonUrl}}">{{organization.name}}</a>.<br><br>

                      What to do:<br>
                      <ul>
                        <li>Check if the person is affiliated with the organization.</li>
                        <li>If yes, make the person an administrator and a team member of the organization and set the
                          status of the request
                          to "accepted" (organization_claim_requests) and the organization to shadow=false.
                        </li>
                        <li>Send the person an email indicating that they are now an administrator of the requested
                          organization (Mail template in the {{supportMail}} inbox).</li>
                        <li>If no, send the person an email requesting further information (Mail template in the
                          {{supportMail}} inbox).</li>
                        <li>If no response is received or the proof cannot be provided, set the status of the request to
                          "rejected" (organization_claim_requests) and inform the person via email.
                        </li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
